  abilityName: Sanctum of the Sea
  abilityDesc: 24 combo powerful Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), activates Water barrier, greatly restores HP for 3 turns, hugely boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns & negates all status ailments and Atk, Def, Rec reduction
    effects for 3 turns
